WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.990
Someone once said...

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:56.520
There are lions that have manes 
of fresh, healthy okra...

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:59.730
Liokra!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:05.100
There are ladybugs with seven 
round slices of richly sweet,

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.800
fragrant banana on their wings...

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:11.570
Ladybananabugs!

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.740
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:20.010
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:25.720
Food Luck Runneth Over! Pilgrimage 
to the Gourmet Shrine!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:42.200
I guess there's no easy path to take

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.140
when it comes to to increasing 
our Food Luck, huh?

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:50.840
I never imagined the Gourmet 
Shrine was like this...

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.750
Komatsu, is this your first time here?

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:58.650
Uh-huh. I mean, I've always wanted to 
come, but never seemed to find the time...

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.590
All chefs should come here at least once.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.890
It's your first time too, 
isn't it, Toriko-san?

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:07.190
I'm not interested in worshiping 
at shrines and stuff...

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.730
Listen when a guy talks!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.830
It's gigantic!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.700
Huh. That's one impressive torii.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.000
Gourmet Shrine

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:19.600
Is this the entrance to the Gourmet Shrine?

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.370
Take a look, everyone!

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:26.280
The area of the Gourmet Shrine 
grounds is 80,000 square kilometers.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.550
Every year, nine billion people

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:30.720
come from all over the 
world to visit the shrine,

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.420
where they make Gourmet Prayers and 
try to get rid of bad Food Luck.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.450
This is what I call a heaping 
helping of a huge shrine!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:41.230
And a major annual event here 
is about to get underway.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:45.860
Gourmet TV's very own Tina 
won't let even one gram

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.830
of this year's super scoop get away!

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.940
Even though it's huge, 
look at all these people.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.840
You'd think this was an amusement park!

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.740
It's said that in the Gourmet Age,

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:59.610
increasing your Food Luck is 
tied into your success in life.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:03.580
Gourmet Hunters, food merchants,

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:07.180
even big shots in the political sphere 
come here to pay their respects.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.420
It's what you might call 
a Gourmet Power Spot.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.420
Toriko?! And Komatsu-kun, too?!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:13.690
Zange!

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:17.030
Oh, Lord, please forgive 
me! I repent my sins...

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:19.060
<i>zange</i> = repent one's sins

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.330
Wha...?! I'm <i>Zonge</i>!

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.960
I did see Toriko and Komatsu-kun 
just now, didn't I?

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.900
How long does that paparazzi 
plan on followin' me around?!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.100
Is she gonna sell my photos 
to some weekly tabloid?!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.570
You <i>are</i> famous, Zonge-sama!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.270
Well, that's true...

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.710
That is true... though more like <i>infamous</i>...

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.350
Look at all of these food stands!

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:45.850
Famous restaurant chains 
also have shops here!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:47.290
Alright, let's eat!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.020
That was fast!

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.430
Get it while it's hot!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.260
Bean Sprout Worms and Stir-fried Garlips!

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:55.930
Wow! Natural Garlips!

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.930
I'll take everything you're 
fryin' up there, Pops!

00:04:58.930 --> 00:04:59.770
Much obliged!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:03.340
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:04.940
Let's eat!

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:12.610
I can't get enough of these 
crispy, fresh bean sprouts

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.550
or this appetite-stimulating aroma of garlic!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.020
Baked Moai Potatoes!

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:18.950
There you are.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.120
Thank you. It's hot, so be careful.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:22.990
Thank you!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:25.530
Mmm! A freshly baked Moai Potato!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.960
Substantial, sweet, and fragrant!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:33.500
She's also cookin' dreamy-tasting, 
cream-packed Dream Chestnuts!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.800
Gimme ten of 'em, Granny!

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:35.940
You got it!

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:39.070
At any rate, this sure is a lively place.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.710
It's like a festival.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.940
There are over 300 functions 
a year at the Gourmet Shrine.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.250
It's like they hold a festival 
or public event every single day.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.150
If you're able to open a shop 
at a lucky place like this,

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:52.620
I bet your Food Luck will improve, too.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.590
More like you already need to be 
really lucky to open a shop here.

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:00.260
There are as many people 
who wanna set up shop

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.930
here in the Gourmet Shrine as 
there are stars in the sky.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:07.000
Among them, the only ones who actually 
can open their shop in these huge grounds

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.770
are the 777 winners of the monthly drawing.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.940
777 shops?! Lucky seven?!

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:16.580
So the ones who get picked 
are incredibly lucky?

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:20.310
In a power spot like this, people become 
magnanimous and thanks to the visitors

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.820
who loosen their purse strings, the 
majority of the shops flourish.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.020
Money comes to those who are lucky.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:30.790
Naturally, there are shops 
that aren't as lucky.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.460
Fruit of the Gourmet Tree

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:39.600
Even though I set up shop under 
the Sacred Gourmet Tree...

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:42.330
I guess it just doesn't taste good...

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.700
Isn't this Gourmet Tree Fruit?!

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:46.340
That's right...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.870
Sell me all this fruit, Pops!

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.740
You'll buy all of them?!

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.310
You've become totally 
magnanimous, Toriko-san!

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.080
Thank you!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:59.020
Crunchy rind and a soft, creamy, 
sweet and sour fruit within...

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:03.320
It's a gentle, delicate taste, huh?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.560
Th-That washing fountain is huge!

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:13.500
It's sacred spring water, Holy Water.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:18.540
Visitors rinse their hands and mouth to 
purify them, then make their pilgrimage.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.800
Acacia's Full Course Pilgrimage.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:23.270
Acacia's Full Course Pilgrimage?!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:27.210
This is a place where Acacia, 
the Gourmet God, is worshiped.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:31.250
Before you get to the main shrine, 
where Acacia's statue is,

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.980
you pay tribute to Acacia's Full Course

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.280
by praying at each of the 
food temples in order,

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.090
starting with the appetizer.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.260
Delicious!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.030
It's paying tribute to the Full Course,

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.190
but of course, the food isn't actually there.

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.260
Even the names aren't listed.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:52.940
Too bad! I thought I'd actually 
get to see Acacia's Full Course.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.540
What is that?!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.210
Sorry to keep you waiting, Toriko-sama.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:04.280
This is a sheep that can 
carry passengers, a Taxsheep.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.750
Taxsheep?!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.790
Yes. You can ride on this to travel 
all over the grounds in comfort.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.850
I reserved one for us.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:15.490
Thank you for your patronage.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.600
After all, it's 80,000 square 
kilometers, a huge expanse of land.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.100
Walking around the entire place 
on foot takes several months.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:28.440
Actually, there are hotels and other 
lodging facilities on the grounds

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.810
and some visitors spend several 
months on their pilgrimage.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:37.680
Well, enjoy your pilgrimage.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:40.410
Make sure your seatbelt's on tight!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.620
I-It's fast!

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.320
The max speed of a Taxsheep 
is 150 kilometers per hour.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.760
Of course, it's a safe driver, so relax!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.630
Are you sure?!

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:31.530
Food Fortunes

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.790
Look! Food fortune telling!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.360
They've got Food Fortunes!

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.460
I think I'll get one to try my luck!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.100
Hey! We don't have time to loiter on the way!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.010
Gourmet Talismans

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:42.070
Huh. They sell good luck charms, too.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:48.150
"Gourmet Success". "So that you may 
come across delicious meals..."

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.850
That's the wish of every living 
human in the Gourmet Age.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.850
"Rich Diet in Abundance"...

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:58.120
A prayer for an abundant catch for 
people in the fishery industry.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.530
This one is "Reducing Fat and Slender".

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.730
A beauty talisman, eh?

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:05.760
I got "poor harvest"...

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:07.730
What was yours, Toriko-san?

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.800
I got "bumper crop".

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.800
Lucky you...

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.710
I guess this is better than 
"terrible harvest", anyway...

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:17.110
Then you should just buy 
this good luck charm.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:19.480
"Cooking Techniques Good Luck Charm"?

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.680
"To improve your cooking skills..."

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.580
"So that you may encounter 
rare ingredients..."

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:27.850
This is a good luck talisman 
that's tailor-made for chefs.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:28.950
I'll take this one, please!

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:30.920
That'll be 600 yen.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:32.820
Okay, let's go.

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:49.410
The sacred trees of the Gourmet 
Shrine, Gourmet Cedar,

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.310
or just called Gourmet Trees.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.910
These trees are enormous!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:59.250
Gourmet Trees grow all over shrine property, 
but the ones here are the biggest.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:03.350
It's said that Acacia's partner, 
Froese, called the "God Chef",

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:08.220
made his cutting board and various 
other tools out of these lucky trees.

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:10.630
Cooking tools from these trees...

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:15.060
Come to think of it, a Full Course 
has eight dishes on the menu, right?

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.930
But the number of food 
temples is only seven...

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:19.530
There it is, Komatsu!

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:37.050
That's... the Gourmet Shrine's main shrine!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:58.970
What's that?!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.440
A portable shrine, huh?

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:05.410
It figures the area around the 
main shrine is especially lively.

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:24.460
It's really impressive up close, huh?

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:27.730
It's even bigger than the 
torii at the entrance.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:31.870
A fitting symbol of the Gourmet 
Age that deifies Acacia.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.940
Acacia's statue is inside here...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.190
There's clearly a different 
air about this place.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.190
Outside of eating,

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:55.130
this is the first time I've felt 
something has been full of life.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:01.030
There's something in the air here...

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:03.130
It's unmistakably...

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.270
Food Luck!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.110
The source of this Food Luck...

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.190
Not exaggerated at all...

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:32.500
It's life-sized...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:40.870
This man... is the Gourmet God... Acacia!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.010
Thank you.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:14:02.190
Those were the only words that 
came forth from our hearts.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.230
Huh?

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:17.470
Toriko-san, do you think our 
Food Luck has increased?

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:18.810
I dunno...

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:20.280
Shall we give it a try?

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:23.410
Alright, it's come around again!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.280
The big annual event...

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.080
Choosing the Gourmet Man!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:32.850
Whoever's able to pull that knife 
out of this massive cutting board

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:37.090
made of sacred Gourmet Cedar will 
become this year's Gourmet Man!

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:42.030
Who will win the title of Gourmet Man?!

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.430
How solid is this wood?!

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:48.700
Move! I'm next!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:52.570
I'm gonna pull it out if 
it's the last thing I do!

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:55.110
It can't be pulled out by strength alone!

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:58.010
If you don't read the grain of the 
wood and aren't exquisitely delicate,

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.650
you won't be able to 
budge the knife one gram!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:03.280
The temperature and humidity also play 
a part, so when all is said and done,

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:04.620
what you really need is luck!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:08.560
Move it! Zonge-sama will 
clear this in a flash!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.560
Good luck, Zonge-sama!

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:13.190
The only luck he has is bad...

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:15.160
Leave this to me!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:31.280
What is this stupid game?! It's boring!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.090
Zonge-sama!

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.720
3-2-1...

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.890
Okay, our second challenger 
has given up the goose.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:49.000
Who will be our next challenger?!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.200
She's not even counting him...

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.500
What do you think, Komatsu?

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:54.130
Shall we give it a shot?

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:58.370
The "Gourmet Man" is 
someone who has Food Luck.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:15:59.810
It's worth a try, don't you think?

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:04.440
Alright. I'll try it.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.910
Okay, our next challenger has come forward.

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:11.320
This one has a rather small stature...

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.980
Huh? Komatsu-kun?!

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:14.020
Komatsu...

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.050
Huh? Isn't that Chef Komatsu?

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.420
The one from Hotel Gourmet?

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.590
The Chef Komatsu who made the Century Soup...

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:20.430
It is him!

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:21.560
What's he doing here?!

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.790
It's Chef Komatsu!

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.360
Wow!

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:29.730
It's a beautifully even grain.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.570
This is a tough, high quality cutting board

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:35.410
made from wood near the heart of the tree.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:40.540
And this is a good, well-used knife.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.250
But there's something 
peculiar about the curve

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.280
from the ridges to the point of the knife.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:49.720
The blade isn't in there vertically 
but slightly diagonally...

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.560
Lightly... like this...

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.000
He pulled it out!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.130
The Gourmet Shrine chose...

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:05.140
Acacia, the Gourmet God, chose 
this year's Gourmet Man!

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:07.470
Chef Komatsu of Hotel Gourmet!

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:10.540
This is definitely a scoop moment!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.210
You did great, Komatsu!

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:15.550
Chef Komatsu will receive a 
one-year supply of food coupons

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:16.980
for any shop in the entire shrine!

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:19.120
Congratulations!

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.720
Th-Thank you!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.120
Alright, we're not finished yet!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.420
There's one more Gourmet Man event!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:30.560
And it's already begun!

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.930
There are hundreds of thousands 
of Gourmet Trees on the property.

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:36.770
Out of all the fruit in those trees, 
just one is the winning fruit!

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:40.270
Whoever finds that fruit will 
become our other Gourmet Man!

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:43.610
Incidentally, the seed inside 
the winning fruit is yellow.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.240
What? Yellow...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.340
I ate that one a while ago. Look...

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:51.480
It's been found already?!

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:55.550
Wow! Our second Gourmet Man is none 
other than the Gourmet Hunter, Toriko!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:59.590
Toriko also possesses powerful Food Luck!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.420
That's incredible, Toriko-san!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:04.290
You were luckier than me, Komatsu.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:07.800
Even though you had a lousy Food 
Fortune, you became Gourmet Man.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.860
In a way, it's more awesome than me!

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:14.140
Toriko-san, that was amazing!

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:17.270
Shake my hand, Chef Komatsu!

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.540
Father Papo...

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.940
It seems this year's 
choosing of the Gourmet Men

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:24.880
ended on an exceptionally high note.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:29.720
To live is to get hungry.

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:33.020
Good fortune begins with eating.

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:40.190
Food Luck fills your stomach, your 
heart, your life, your whole existence.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:46.030
As such, all of our visitors 
cling to Acacia-sama's Food Luck.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:50.770
They desperately wish for 
it, for their own benefit.

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:56.240
With all this land, what kind of 
Gourmet Tree had the winning fruit?

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.310
It was at a shop near the 
entrance to the shrine!

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.650
The fruit was delicious!

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.850
You should all go there.

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:04.780
You can all use my year's 
worth of food coupons!

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:05.750
Are you sure?!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:06.450
Yes!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:07.790
Thank you, Chef Komatsu!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.590
Not at all!

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:12.260
They're...

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:13.330
Yes.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.030
It's been a long time...

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.800
...since there were people 
who unbegrudgingly shared

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.630
their overflowing Food Luck 
with those around them.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.300
Acacia-sama...

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:28.470
Is that why you look unusually happy?

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:35.610
Perhaps those two will 
become your successors...

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:39.920
Toriko-san, if I recall,

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:43.390
the shop that sold Gourmet Tree 
fruit is just ahead, right?

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.360
Yeah. I've got to stop by before 
we leave and thank the old man

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.490
since it's because of him 
that I'm a Gourmet Man!

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:53.360
W-Why is there suddenly a line?!

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:53.860
This is the place!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:54.830
Got a good feeling about this!

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.270
One Gourmet Tree fruit, please!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:59.000
Food Luck's come my way!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.170
What the hell?

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:04.410
And I thought I'd buy up his Gourmet 
Tree fruit for the way home...

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:06.610
It works out this way too, 
doesn't it, Toriko-san?

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.780
Well, I guess you're right.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.390
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:26.230
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:28.970
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:31.800
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.640
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:37.470
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:40.210
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.010
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.710
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.380
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.820
and it'll be more and more

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:50.150
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.960
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.820
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:21:00.100
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:01.430
Such a waste!

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:04.270
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:07.070
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:12.670
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.580
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:19.080
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:22.580
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:28.520
Our guest today is one of the seven 
IGO-elected palate masters, G7's Patch-san!

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:36.260
Patch, Palate Master, G7

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:33.090
As a G7 member, I heard you possess 
the astonishing palate that can detect

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:38.270
the flavor of a single grain of 
sugar melted in a 25-meter pool!

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:42.770
Today, we'll determine whether 
that ability really is first-rate

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:45.340
by verifying it in front of our cameras.

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:48.480
It's called "G7 Rating Check"!

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:54.310
This time, Hotel Gourmet gave us permission 
to use their actual 25-meter pool,

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:58.650
into which we added a single 
drop of a certain flavor.

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:02.260
I'd like you to drink this and tell me 
what you think was dissolved in the pool.

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.260
There is nothing my tongue cannot do.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.760
Then start!

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:11.600
Ozone Grass and Black Grass tea, 
deeply blended with a 7:3 ratio...

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.630
Its bitterness subdued from being extracted

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:15.270
from a lower temperature than usual...

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:17.070
Too much information, but correct!

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:18.800
Alright, the second test! What's this?

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:21.840
A single fleck of spice from 
a roasted piece of mochi,

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:23.380
its flavor erased with ginger.

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:24.410
Think you're so smart!

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.150
How can you figure it out that quickly?!

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.880
Alright, how about this one?!

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:31.780
Nothing is impossible for my tongue.

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:34.450
This is...

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:37.420
Oh, my! What's that reaction?!

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:40.090
That scent is incomparable!

00:22:40.090 --> 00:22:41.060
It can't be anything else!

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:43.560
The flavor comes from that man...

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:45.630
That's right! When a certain 
person was a guest on this show,

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.030
they drank some of that water!

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:49.130
So tell me, who was that guest?!

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.400
Z-Zombie...

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:53.540
Close, but no cigar! The correct answer...

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:55.270
...is Zange!

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:58.010
Who the hell is Zange?! Cut it out!

00:22:59.680 --> 00:23:01.610
H-H-Hold on!

00:23:02.780 --> 00:23:05.050
Alright, let's go on to the next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.750
The more surprised they are, the better they taste?

00:23:10.220 --> 00:23:11.760
Huh? This isn't good enough?

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:13.360
Okay, in that case...

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:16.930
Uwaaa! Astonishing Stun Apple!

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:18.910
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
